         <component>
            <section ID="L83cf9f7c-99b7-45a2-878c-2b34e9fadedc">
               <id root="5d09a498-bffc-b024-e063-6294a90aa9f8"/>
               <code code="34067-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE SECTION"/>
               <title>
                  <content styleCode="italics">Uses</content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>• Helps prevent sunburn • If used as directed with other sun protection measures (see Directions), decreases the risk of skin cancer and early skin aging caused by the sun. 
  <br/>
                  </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20220524"/>
            </section>
         </component>
